{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214150","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321415001:1":{"text":"你们怎么又来了？解酒的东西可不能多喝！","source_cn":"你们怎么又来了？解酒的东西可不能多喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7095F8CE1777DB6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321415002:1":{"text":"不不不，我们是来找人的！刚才有没有一个年轻男人经过这里？","source_cn":"不不不，我们是来找人的！刚才有没有一个年轻男人经过这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6756AF3EB1413D03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321415003:1":{"text":"外貌特点的话……嗯，他长得和我们身边这个小朋友有点像，身上还有酒味。","source_cn":"外貌特点的话……嗯，他长得和我们身边这个小朋友有点像，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B893F913AC7940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321415004:1":{"text":"噢，刚才的确有那么个年轻人经过。","source_cn":"噢，刚才的确有那么个年轻人经过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE17DB15A182600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321415005:1":{"text":"他过去的时候，还嘟嘟囔囔地说着什么，好像是在说自己不是懦夫之类的话吧。反正听起来有点蠢。","source_cn":"他过去的时候，还嘟嘟囔囔地说着什么，好像是在说自己不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAEF87606CAA8817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":""